---
title: Final Report Archive Loop
---
flowchart TD
  S[IncidentState\nplan execute verify replan] --> FR[finalReportAgent.Run]
  FR --> SUM[buildFinalOpsSummary\ninferFinalStatus]
  SUM --> P[persistFinalOpsReport]
  P --> FILE[(logs/ops_reports/*.md\nfrontmatter + report)]
  P --> G{finalOpsArchiveEligibility}
  G -->|fail| SKIP[Skip archive\nlog reasons]
  G -->|pass| DOC[schema.Document\nfull final report]
  DOC --> META[metadata\nops_final_report + plan/verify/replan]
  META --> MV[(Milvus ops_cases_v2)]
  META --> BM[BM25 ProfileOpsCase]
  FILE --> LOCAL[retrieveLocalFinalReports]
  MV --> HY[Hybrid RAG ops_case]
  BM --> HY
  LOCAL --> MERGE[mergeOpsCaseResults]
  HY --> MERGE
  MERGE --> NEXT[Next incident\nops_case_retrieve result]
